+# Synthetica 3.2 feature layer: MGLRU reclaim + uclamp on top of CASS/WALT
+# MGLRU stores gen/memcg/nid in the radix-tree shadow entry, and on this tree that
+# budget only fits when MEMCG is on (MEM_CGROUP_ID_SHIFT 16 is reserved either way,
